# Build context hygiene. Anything here is invisible to `docker build`.

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Generated by `prisma generate` — the image regenerates it (ADRs 0033, 0043).
apps/api/src/generated

# Secrets never enter the build context, let alone the image (ADR 0036).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.github
docs
**/test
*.md
